Hello, I came up with an idea, here I implemented it for you.

[list]List of changes:
[*] Now you can carry some small things (for example: Rockets (not all), crates);
[b](( In order to move things, you need to stand in front of the object and hold down the left click and move the mouse )[/b])
[*] Removed the tree that was sticking out of the house (Well, I didn’t see it, but you didn’t say it);
[*] Added a few more trees to the map, also grass;
[*] Moved a little different things for visual beauty;
[/list]


Enjoy the game and as always waiting for your feedback, thank you all)

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43945002/189b4172f3e03e0784f092448a02391441fd449e.gif[/img]

Hello, I read the reviews on the game, I made a small update for you.

[list]List of changes:
[*] The sack barricade is down. (before that it was a little in the air);
[*] At the request of one player: The girl's nipples have become brighter, prettier and larger;
[*] Fixed a bug when the player got stuck at one poster;
[*] Corrected the corpse near the crashed plane;
[*] A few changes in the location that you most likely will not notice, but I was pissed off;
[/list]

Enjoy the game, I'm waiting for your feedback and especially suggestions on what to add. Have a good day :)

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43945002/189b4172f3e03e0784f092448a02391441fd449e.gif[/img]

And so I am writing to you about a new update that no one in general reads, well, okay, and what has been updated in my game today?

[list]List of changes:
[*] Reduced size of jeeps;
[*] The T-34 tank is now trying to go on the attack a little more;
[*] One of the Nazi trucks is also rolling now;
[*] A Nazi hat has appeared on the map, which you can pick up and put on your head :)
[*] In one place, in the explosion, your girl loses her bra and exposes her charms;
[/list]

Enjoy the game, I hope for your feedback ^_^
[url=https://twitter.com/darklightstudi2]Twitter[/url]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43945002/189b4172f3e03e0784f092448a02391441fd449e.gif[/img]

New day, new update

[list]And what do we have here?:
[*] Fixed bug with radio when one radio was destroyed, all others were destroyed as well. Now you need to destroy all the radio yourself;
[*] Fixed a bug with the end of the game button, when it did not appear or when the player blew up the equipment, the game ended, now you can completely end the game only by pressing the button near the Boss;
[*] Added the corpse of the pilot of the falling aircraft;
[*] Added 2 new achievements;
[*] Map updated;
[/list]


Thank you for playing my game, I hope for feedback from you.


